### Routes — CREATE (expects 201 Created)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ruta Centro",
  "municipality": "Riohacha",
  "description": "Recorrido diario por el sector centro de Riohacha",
  "status": "active"
}

### Routes — CREATE without municipality (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ruta sin municipio"
}

### Routes — CREATE duplicate name in the same municipality (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ruta Centro",
  "municipality": "Riohacha"
}
